OL,3,GNEWSA'Hole in the ground' fear during
OL,4,Aex-library site sale
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople in Baildon are demanding answers
OL,7,Fover the future of their former library
OL,8,Fsite after the council put the land up
OL,9,Ffor sale.
OL,11,FIan Clough Hall, which housed Baildon
OL,12,FLibrary and other community facilities,
OL,13,Fwas demolished in 2023. Developer
OL,14,FMcCarthy Stone had planned to build 47
OL,15,Fretirement apartments on the site but
OL,16,Fpulled out last year.
OL,18,FBradford Council confirmed the land is
OL,19,Fset to be sold as part of its "asset
OL,20,Fdisposal programme and medium-term
OL,21,Ffinancial strategy".
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
